Materialize a multi-file preview

Usage: xrm config render [OPTIONS] PROFILE

POSITIONALS:
  PROFILE (required)      Exact Profile name or UUID (saved configuration) 

OPTIONS:
  -h,   --help            Show this help message 

GLOBAL OPTIONS (before the command):
        --socket PATH     xrmd Unix domain socket 
        --json            Write machine readable output 
        --verbose         Include original diagnostics in human errors 

Examples:
  xrm config render Home

Profile accepts an exact saved name or UUID.
